Which is the graph of $y = f^{-1}(x)$?

[asy]
unitsize(0.5 cm);

picture[] graf;
int i, n;

real func(real x) {
  return (log(x));
}

path foo = graph(func,exp(-5),5); 

for (n = 1; n <= 5; ++n) {
